{"3503350":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Stick N' Sheep","steam_appid":3503350,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to<\/strong> <strong>Stick N' Sheep<\/strong>, the wildly chaotic multiplayer party game where up to 8 sheep battle it out in a whirlwind of crazy mini-games!<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget the game board, this is pure, fast-paced, and hilarious action. Whether you're flying solo or teaming up, take on friends (or foes) in a wide variety of mini-games: from reflex tests to team chaos, unexpected twists, and much more.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3503350\/extras\/63c864a92c010fe517ec5abc48cd0511.poster.avif?t=1793725122\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3503350\/extras\/63c864a92c010fe517ec5abc48cd0511.webm?t=1793725122\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3503350\/extras\/63c864a92c010fe517ec5abc48cd0511.mp4?t=1793725122\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your sheep with loads of wacky outfits and unlock even more as you play. From rainbow mohawks to inflatable suits, show off your woolly style with pride!<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3503350\/extras\/5093ae5d6dea0e650de3118f62bddfe8.poster.avif?t=1793725122\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3503350\/extras\/5093ae5d6dea0e650de3118f62bddfe8.webm?t=1793725122\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3503350\/extras\/5093ae5d6dea0e650de3118f62bddfe8.mp4?t=1793725122\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its colorful 3D cartoon visuals and a tone that swings between absurd humor and fierce competition, Stick N' Sheep is made for game nights, belly laughs, and backstabbing between two fluffy rivals.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3503350\/extras\/53f2d1c18d8db353dc3005563562c88d.poster.avif?t=1793725122\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3503350\/extras\/53f2d1c18d8db353dc3005563562c88d.webm?t=1793725122\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3503350\/extras\/53f2d1c18d8db353dc3005563562c88d.mp4?t=1793725122\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready to slide, jump, charge, fall… and bleat your way to victory!<\/strong><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to<\/strong> <strong>Stick N' Sheep<\/strong>, the wildly chaotic multiplayer party game where up to 8 sheep battle it out in a whirlwind of crazy mini-games!<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget the game board, this is pure, fast-paced, and hilarious action. Whether you're flying solo or teaming up, take on friends (or foes) in a wide variety of mini-games: from reflex tests to team chaos, unexpected twists, and much more.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3503350\/extras\/63c864a92c010fe517ec5abc48cd0511.poster.avif?t=1793725122\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3503350\/extras\/63c864a92c010fe517ec5abc48cd0511.webm?t=1793725122\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3503350\/extras\/63c864a92c010fe517ec5abc48cd0511.mp4?t=1793725122\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your sheep with loads of wacky outfits and unlock even more as you play. From rainbow mohawks to inflatable suits, show off your woolly style with pride!<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3503350\/extras\/5093ae5d6dea0e650de3118f62bddfe8.poster.avif?t=1793725122\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3503350\/extras\/5093ae5d6dea0e650de3118f62bddfe8.webm?t=1793725122\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3503350\/extras\/5093ae5d6dea0e650de3118f62bddfe8.mp4?t=1793725122\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its colorful 3D cartoon visuals and a tone that swings between absurd humor and fierce competition, Stick N' Sheep is made for game nights, belly laughs, and backstabbing between two fluffy rivals.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3503350\/extras\/53f2d1c18d8db353dc3005563562c88d.poster.avif?t=1793725122\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3503350\/extras\/53f2d1c18d8db353dc3005563562c88d.webm?t=1793725122\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3503350\/extras\/53f2d1c18d8db353dc3005563562c88d.mp4?t=1793725122\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready to slide, jump, charge, fall… and bleat your way to victory!<\/strong><\/p>","short_description":"Join the woolly madness! A chaotic 2 to 8 player party game where an avalanche of crazy minigames awaits you. In a colorful cartoon world, push, betray, and survive to become the smartest… or luckiest sheep!","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Danish, Greek, Indonesian, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Czech, Thai, Turkish, Vietnamese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3503350\/73db8feccd892df26b369b90436f0f5dea7bc565\/header.jpg?t=1793725122","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3503350\/2017cfdeddaac1d05f58a603a8ee7ee5929e5545\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793725122","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3503350\/2017cfdeddaac1d05f58a603a8ee7ee5929e5545\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793725122","website":"https:\/\/www.makimastudio.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><stro